OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 30 Jul to Sat 8 AugFDry
OL,6,Fat first across the south with sunny
OL,7,Fperiods, where it will also be very
OL,8,Fwarm. Cloudier in the north with
OL,9,Fshowers or some longer outbreaks of
OL,10,Frain, which could be heavy in places,
OL,11,Fand temperatures nearer normal. It
OL,12,Fwill probably become more changeable
OL,13,Fthereafter, with potential for an area
OL,14,Fof low pressure to move close to or
OL,15,Facross the UK at the start of August.
OL,16,FThis could bring spells of heavy rain
OL,17,Fand perhaps some strong winds for a
OL,18,Ftime. It may become more settled again
OL,19,Ftoward the end of the first week of
OL,20,FAugust.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
